{"4377690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Secret of Island of Fear", "steam_appid": 4377690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Secret of Island of Fear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dark Bargain, A Deadly Exchange: Can You Outsmart the Island?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped on a desolate island, you and your friends find yourselves at the mercy of the <strong>Djinn</strong>, a sinister entity that rules this land. To win your freedom, you must provide the Djinn with three sacred items. But there is a catch: the items are scattered, and survival depends on more than just searching—it depends on who you can trust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Djinn teleports four players to distinct, haunting regions of the island. Your mission is to find the required items, but you will soon realize that you don’t have everything you need. To escape, you must reunite and trade with your companions. But in this game, a handshake is often a mask for a lie.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade or Deceive:</strong> Not every item is what it seems. Trade with your teammates to complete your set, but beware—players can swap <strong>fake items</strong> to trick you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Price of a Lie:</strong> Trust is a luxury. If a player is caught lying or offering counterfeit goods, the island’s ancient curse will trigger a brutal punishment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong> Navigate through a massive, haunting <strong>Castle</strong> and rot-filled <strong>Dungeons</strong>. Every shadow hides a secret, and every corner holds a heart-pounding <strong>Jump Scare</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Thief Dwarves:</strong> You aren’t the only ones lurking in the dark. Watch out for the <strong>Thief Dwarves</strong>—small, agile scavengers ready to snatch your precious items when you least expect it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> It’s not just about the monsters in the dark; it’s about the person standing next to you. Will you collaborate for a group escape, or betray your friends for a solo ticket home?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you uncover the secret of the island, or will the Djinn claim your soul in the depths of the dungeon?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yayıncı Notu (Küçük Tavsiyeler):</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short Description (Kısa Özet) Kısmı İçin:</strong> &quot;Trade, lie, and survive. Gather 3 items for the Djinn to escape, but watch out for fake trades and the lurking thief dwarves in this psychological horror experience.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Etiketler (Tags):</strong> Multiplayer, Psychological Horror, Social Manipulation, Co-op, Survival Horror.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Secret of Island of Fear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dark Bargain, A Deadly Exchange: Can You Outsmart the Island?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped on a desolate island, you and your friends find yourselves at the mercy of the <strong>Djinn</strong>, a sinister entity that rules this land. To win your freedom, you must provide the Djinn with three sacred items. But there is a catch: the items are scattered, and survival depends on more than just searching—it depends on who you can trust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Djinn teleports four players to distinct, haunting regions of the island. Your mission is to find the required items, but you will soon realize that you don’t have everything you need. To escape, you must reunite and trade with your companions. But in this game, a handshake is often a mask for a lie.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade or Deceive:</strong> Not every item is what it seems. Trade with your teammates to complete your set, but beware—players can swap <strong>fake items</strong> to trick you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Price of a Lie:</strong> Trust is a luxury. If a player is caught lying or offering counterfeit goods, the island’s ancient curse will trigger a brutal punishment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong> Navigate through a massive, haunting <strong>Castle</strong> and rot-filled <strong>Dungeons</strong>. Every shadow hides a secret, and every corner holds a heart-pounding <strong>Jump Scare</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Thief Dwarves:</strong> You aren’t the only ones lurking in the dark. Watch out for the <strong>Thief Dwarves</strong>—small, agile scavengers ready to snatch your precious items when you least expect it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> It’s not just about the monsters in the dark; it’s about the person standing next to you. Will you collaborate for a group escape, or betray your friends for a solo ticket home?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you uncover the secret of the island, or will the Djinn claim your soul in the depths of the dungeon?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yayıncı Notu (Küçük Tavsiyeler):</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short Description (Kısa Özet) Kısmı İçin:</strong> &quot;Trade, lie, and survive. Gather 3 items for the Djinn to escape, but watch out for fake trades and the lurking thief dwarves in this psychological horror experience.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Etiketler (Tags):</strong> Multiplayer, Psychological Horror, Social Manipulation, Co-op, Survival Horror.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Experience a high-tension, first-person horror journey where you take control of a character stranded on a dark, mysterious island. Surrounded by eerie entities and chilling secrets, you must uncover the truth hidden within the shadows. Can you solve the island's mystery and survive the nightmare?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377690/d1617cea52a8a2a1ac07e238009b5f14848004ce/header.jpg?t=1788263272", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377690/14aebad2a498f62ef2ca9fbb68785f0bc227b117/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788263272", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377690/14aebad2a498f62ef2ca9fbb68785f0bc227b117/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788263272", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> win10-11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core 2 Duo E6600 2.4GHz ya da AMD Athlon 64 X2 Dual Core 5600+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GeForce 780or AMD Radeon 7950 (3 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3072 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> win10-11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core 4 Duo E6600 2.4GHz ya da AMD Athlon 64 X2 Dual Core 5600+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GeForce 970/1050<br></li><li><s